The biggest drag has been our exposure to Bitcoin miners and powered-land companies, particularly in Texas.

NODE is built to provide balanced exposure across the digital-asset value chain, while managing risks around excessive leverage, bad governance and other pitfalls common in crypto. Spot Bitcoin is our largest position and our allocation to other digital assets has been rising.

We think this leaves us well positioned for a recovery in our beaten-down Texas exposure and a renewed Bitcoin bull market.

My personal crypto exposure is roughly 50% Bitcoin / 50% NODE. I bought more NODE this morning to remain a top-10 shareholder of the ETF.

